<blockquote>
<p>来自 <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpion451" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1918720); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1918720&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608026104" alt="Scorpion451" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1918720)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpion451" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1918720); return false;">Scorpion451</a></span> 的 <strong><a style="color:#9C6014" href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scorpion-pit">蝎子洞</a></strong> 。<br />
