</div>
<blockquote>
<p>来自 <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1621343); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1621343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608026104" alt="SunnyClockwork" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1621343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1621343); return false;">SunnyClockwork</a></span> 的 <strong><a style="color:dark_red" href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/sunny-s-black-and-white-art">SunnyClockwork的艺作中心页</a></strong> 。<br />
<span style="font-size:85%;"><em>没啥好说的。阳阳，永远滴神。没看过的话建议你们都去看一下。</em></span></p>
</blockquote>
