<p>我很無聊：<br />
Oh, what a lovely whether. Look, the guy just pass by was dru-, oh wait Lord Jesus, what just happened here, oh my gosh, what a terrible scene, I swear, my friend, this must be the most horrible thing I've ever seen, oh my god, look at him, his organs&#8230; On no, what happened to this poor man, may lord bless me, I really hoped the police will arrive soon.</p>
<p>對了兄弟，翻譯腔怎麽能少了 “我敢打賭”</p>

