		<div class="post" id="post-4845318">
		<div class="long">
			<div class="head">
								<div class="title" id="post-title-4845318">
																	<a href="/forum/t-13941270/#post-4845318">新人报道</a>
									</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-sa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7123055); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7123055&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608042459" alt="Doctor sa" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7123055)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-sa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7123055); return false;" >Doctor sa</a></span> <span class="odate time_1608031400 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">15 Dec 2020 11:23</span>
																	<br/>
						讨论中 <a href="/forum/c-882993/">新人自我介绍 / 新人报到区</a> &raquo;
						<a href="/forum/t-13941270/">新人报道</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4845318">
									

<p>第一次见，各位，在以后的日子里希望大家多多关照，我一定会为基金会做贡献的。</p>

							</div>

								
					
						<div class="options">
				
																			</div>
									
			<div id="post-options-4845318" class="options" style="display: none">
			</div>
