		<div class="post" id="post-4845313">
		<div class="long">
			<div class="head">
								<div class="title" id="post-title-4845313">
																	<a href="/scp-cn-1334/comments/show#post-4845313"></a>
									</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mendel-dreemurr" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6764430); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6764430&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608042459" alt="Mendel Dreemurr" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6764430)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mendel-dreemurr" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6764430); return false;" >Mendel Dreemurr</a></span> <span class="odate time_1608030068 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">15 Dec 2020 11:01</span>
																	<br/>
						讨论中 <a href="/forum/c-675245/">单页讨论 / 单页讨论</a> &raquo;
						<a href="/scp-cn-1334/comments/show">SCP-CN-1334</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4845313">
									

<p>我也想尽力帮那个徒儿写Cool啊╯﹏╰（AWCY内部也确实说了认为他不cool呀。这就是不cool）</p>
<hr />
<p>我有预想那个大火蔓延的壮观场景。可我写着写着，突然发觉居然只能发挥成在回收记录里一笔带过。（其他哪个部分我都没法进行展开描写，毕竟这里是SCP项目而不是故事）</p>
<hr />
<p>我果然还是太菜了(⊙x⊙;)，深刻的体会着呼之不出的痛苦呜呜</p>

							</div>

										<div class="signature">
					<hr class="signature-separator"/>
					

<p>There is a garden inside of me .</p>

				</div>
					
					
						<div class="options">
				
																			</div>
									
			<div id="post-options-4845313" class="options" style="display: none">
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="short">
						<a class="title" href="javascript:;" ></a> 由 <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mendel-dreemurr" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6764430); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6764430&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608042459" alt="Mendel Dreemurr" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6764430)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mendel-dreemurr" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6764430); return false;" >Mendel Dreemurr</a></span>, <span class="odate time_1608030068 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">15 Dec 2020 11:01</span>
		</div>
	</div>
 
                      
		<div class="post" id="post-4845309">
		<div class="long">
			<div class="head">
								<div class="title" id="post-title-4845309">
																	<a href="/scp-cn-1334/comments/show#post-4845309"></a>
									</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-jackal" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6627245); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6627245&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608042459" alt="Doctor Jackal" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6627245)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-jackal" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6627245); return false;" >Doctor Jackal</a></span> <span class="odate time_1608029367 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">15 Dec 2020 10:49</span>
																	<br/>
						讨论中 <a href="/forum/c-675245/">单页讨论 / 单页讨论</a> &raquo;
						<a href="/scp-cn-1334/comments/show">SCP-CN-1334</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4845309">
									

<p>其实我反而认为这个点子不需要加长，写成一个短篇就非常好了，但我认为作者并没有在描述那里给我Cool的感觉，作为一个短篇缺少张力，或许可以再斟酌斟酌。</p>

							</div>

								
					
